14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll confirm the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’m glad we’re aligned on the structural survey. It’s the only way to know if the bay can actually hold what we promise.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,The maintenance log will show if the bay’s load is already straining the system.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I hope the staffing numbers show we aren’t just guessing who will actually be there to help.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I want to see if the paperwork delays are why we keep apologising at the door.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I suspect the invoices will reveal where the budget quietly vanishes before the walls are even hung.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll wait for the survey results before we promise the bay to anything heavy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll review the maintenance log to see if the bay’s load is already straining the system.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the staffing and volunteer lists to see who is actually left to do the work.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’ll check the paperwork delays and the weekend numbers to see where we actually stumble.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll trace the transport and mount invoices to see exactly where the money goes before the season starts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
